  s9: Old execution retired#59; a clear overtook the restart
  s10: A launch resumed the conversation a clear ended
  s11: A new seed grant was issued after clear
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Commit the seed original (acceptance)
  s1 --> s2: Terminate takes transition and fence
  s2 --> s3: Close only the captured pane
  s3 --> s4: Retire CAS and settle the old turn
  s3 --> s5: User requests clear
  s4 --> s5: User requests clear
  s5 --> s6: Advance epoch and mark clearing, including while old I/O is granted
  s6 --> s7: Clear discards the queue and the launching input
  s6 --> s6: Accept an input into the owner queue
  s6 --> s8: Queue the seed again after the clear
  s7 --> s3: Clear drains earlier grants and tears down their exact session
  s7 --> s8: Queue the seed again after the clear
  s3 --> s9: Retire CAS and settle the old turn
  s8 --> s8: Clear drains earlier grants and tears down their exact session or Owner starts the front: register the launch or Install Pending over the vacant row or Observe the create epoch or Compare live epoch and retain create permission or Complete the previously granted create or Observe the input epoch
  s9 --> s8: Queue the seed again after the clear
  s8 --> s10: Owner starts the front: register the launch
  s10 --> s10: Reply to the command or Install Pending over the vacant row or Observe the create epoch or Compare live epoch and retain create permission or Complete the previously granted create or Observe the input epoch
  s8 --> s11: Compare live epoch and retain input permission
  s10 --> s11: Compare live epoch and retain input permission
  s11 --> s11: Complete the previously granted first input or Commit the input's receipt or Bind the source
